{"version":1,"content":"<p>網約車平台日後須持有的網約車服務牌照今（30日）午12時截止申請，有4間公司今日到運輸署提交申請，包括滴滴、高德地圖、以及TADA。</p><p>連同Uber昨日表示已提交申請，累計至少有5間公司公布已提交申請。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:54.785325+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:36:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.266583+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.572198+00:00","content_hash":"d67ce442d5d1e625c8351f7746eea02d5cd75b0cc1138b0bd3435df731b54712","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}